      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So you'll undertake the mission,\r\nthen! Thank you.",
        "Jp" : "討伐をお引き受けくださるのですね！\r\nありがとうございます――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544655,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "E'er since a powerful monster — believed to have\r\nstrayed from the Sacred Grounds — appeared in the\r\nforest, the monsters there\r\nhave become invigorated—",
        "Jp" : "聖域から流れ込んだとみられる強力な魔物が\r\n森に現れてからというもの\r\n森の魔物が活性化してきてしまって――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544656,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis most likely they've been driven from their\r\nformer lairs, or drawn into territorial disputes.",
        "Jp" : "おそらく、これまでの棲みかを追われたり\r\n縄張り争いをしたりするせいでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544657,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ere this turmoil spreads further, the monsters of\r\nthe Sacred Grounds must be contained. Should we\r\nfail, 'tis not beyond possibility the situation\r\nmay become altogether unmanageable—",
        "Jp" : "この騒動が拡大する前に\r\n聖域の魔物を抑え込まねば、手の付けられない\r\n状態になる可能性すらあります――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544658,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis said Dílis has just witnessed a monster in\r\nthe Sacred Grounds — should you inquire of her,\r\nshe'll tell you in detail where the\r\nbeasts are to be found.",
        "Jp" : "ちょうどディリスが聖域の魔物を\r\n目撃したとのこと――\r\n彼女に聞けば、どこに魔物がいるかを\r\n詳しく教えてくれることでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516386,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
